Greek

cue0052347
00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:57.860
in Alexandria 2200

cue0052348
00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:59.900
years ago had to translate

cue0052349
00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:00.760
the word Tora

cue0052350
00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:03.220
they translated as

cue0052351
00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:04.360
nomos

cue0052352
00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:08.060
what does it mean the word nomos

cue0052353
00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:09.780
in Greek

cue0052354
00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:11.880
exactly

cue0052355
00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:13.040
what the word Sharia

cue0052356
00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:15.320
means in Arabic

cue0052357
00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:17.820
and what does the

cue0052358
00:15:17.820 --> 00:15:26.780
word Sharia means in Arabic. Exactly what the word Lex means in Latin. And what the

cue0052359
00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:38.520
word Lex means in Latin. Exactly what the word Loi in French and Lo in English means.

cue0052360
00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:46.020
Properly defined, nomos is the constitution of the Jewish people.

cue0052361
00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:49.360
We have a constitution.

cue0052362
00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:56.520
The constitution of the Jewish people is there in the Sefer Tora.

cue0052363
00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:02.240
The Sefer Tora is the constitution of the Jewish people.

cue0052364
00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:05.180
It is a binding document.

cue0052365
00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:07.880
Who could interpret it?

cue0052366
00:16:08.520 --> 00:16:10.260
Ah, I could interpret it.

cue0052367
00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:15.160
And I have the same right to interpret the Hommash, the Tora,

cue0052368
00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:18.700
as I have the right to interpret the Constitution.

cue0052369
00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:21.500
I could give a very intelligent interpretation,

cue0052370
00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:25.700
but it has no legal bearing.

cue0052371
00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:31.420
The only one who could give the proper interpretation of the Tora

cue0052372
00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:35.840
is the equivalent of the Supreme Court of America.

cue0052373
00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:39.620
And what is the supreme court of the Jewish people?

cue0052374
00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:42.420
The Sanhedrin.

cue0052375
00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:48.820
And who was the first head of the Sanhedrin?

cue0052376
00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.160
Moshe Rabbenu.

cue0052377
00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:57.700
Moshe Rabbenu constituted the first Sanhedrin.

cue0052378
00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.480
The Shivim Zekanim.

cue0052379
00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:04.200
Is that interpretation legally binding?

cue0052380
00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.400
Yes.

cue0052381
00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:09.780
Because they are the Supreme Court of Israel.

cue0052382
00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:13.300
By the way, do you know why 70 people?

cue0052383
00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.740
Why there is 70 people in the Supreme Court of Israel?

cue0052384
00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:18.280
Why?

cue0052385
00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:24.180
You're not going to hear it from anybody else.

cue0052386
00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:31.840
Because when we left Egypt, how many families we were?

cue0052387
00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:34.700
How many?

cue0052388
00:17:34.700 --> 00:18:01.660
No, when we left Egypt. How many families? No, no, 58 families. We were 58 families. 600,000 people coming from 58 families. That's why we have 70 members in the Sanhedrin. Why?

cue0052389
00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:19.360
Every family has one delegate and the tribes, 12 tribes, we have 70. 58 representing the families plus 12 representing each of it.

cue0052390
00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:44.180
That is the basis of a true democracy. Now, very important, with all due respect, Yeshua, the head of the Christian religion, the founder of the religion, he represents the incarnation of the Logos.

cue0052391
00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:53.460
Muhammad, he's a cosmocrator. He's going to be a general who's going to be like Napoleon or Hitler undefeated.

cue0052392
00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:56.780
Going to surrender, everybody's going to surrender under the sword of Muhammad.

cue0052393
00:18:57.340 --> 00:19:03.560
Yes, Musharrab Benu is not a logos, some sort of an angel.

cue0052394
00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:11.260
He's not Napoleon. He is the head of the Jewish court.

cue0052395
00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:31.760
He is the founder of the legal system. So, very clearly, we have a written law, the constitution, we have a supreme court, going all the way up to the Talmud.

cue0052396
00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:35.420
and these laws

cue0052397
